    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a world where gods walk among men - and not all of them have humanity\u2019s best interest at heart.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cursebound</strong>, you play as a god who descends to the human realm to break a devastating curse cast by rival deities. As the corruption spreads, monsters overrun the land, twisting once-peaceful villages into dangerous wastelands. Most humans still live unaware of the growing darkness... but time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a breathtaking fantasy world</strong> where <strong>2D pixel art characters</strong> roam across <strong>vibrant 3D low-poly landscapes</strong>. Battle ferocious creatures, uncover hidden mysteries, and forge bonds with the humans you vowed to protect. But is your mission truly as noble as it seems? Or is there a deeper reason behind your quest to end the curse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Visual Style</strong>: A beautiful blend of 2D pixel art and 3D low-poly environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Adventure</strong>: Unravel the mysteries behind the curse and your own past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest-Based Progression</strong>: Grow stronger by completing quests, helping humans, and unlocking new powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Upgrades</strong>: Customize your abilities and forge your own path through a cursed world teetering on the edge of collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storytelling</strong>: Meet memorable characters, face tough choices, and explore a world full of secrets and hidden lore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The human realm needs a savior. Will you be the god they deserve?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a world where gods walk among men - and not all of them have humanity\u2019s best interest at heart.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cursebound</strong>, you play as a god who descends to the human realm to break a devastating curse cast by rival deities. As the corruption spreads, monsters overrun the land, twisting once-peaceful villages into dangerous wastelands. Most humans still live unaware of the growing darkness... but time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a breathtaking fantasy world</strong> where <strong>2D pixel art characters</strong> roam across <strong>vibrant 3D low-poly landscapes</strong>. Battle ferocious creatures, uncover hidden mysteries, and forge bonds with the humans you vowed to protect. But is your mission truly as noble as it seems? Or is there a deeper reason behind your quest to end the curse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Visual Style</strong>: A beautiful blend of 2D pixel art and 3D low-poly environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Adventure</strong>: Unravel the mysteries behind the curse and your own past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest-Based Progression</strong>: Grow stronger by completing quests, helping humans, and unlocking new powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Upgrades</strong>: Customize your abilities and forge your own path through a cursed world teetering on the edge of collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storytelling</strong>: Meet memorable characters, face tough choices, and explore a world full of secrets and hidden lore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The human realm needs a savior. Will you be the god they deserve?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A story-rich action adventure where you play as a god walking among humans to break a deadly curse. Explore a stylized world blending 2D pixel art and 3D low-poly landscapes, battle corrupted creatures, complete quests, and unlock powerful skills.",
